@startuml sequence-rates-update
title Scheduled rate update
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "RateUpdateScheduler" as Sch
database "shedlock" as Lock
participant "ExchangeRateService" as S
participant "ExternalRateProviderClient" as C
participant "External rate API" as Ext
database "DB" as DB

note over Sch
  On start, then every 1 h. Rate lifetime 3 h from the publication;
  an answer published more than 2 h ago (max-age) or in the future is not valid.
  Time limit ≪ lockAtMostFor 59 min:
  N providers × ≈ 46 s + DB transaction 30 s
  one provider: 3 attempts × (connect 10 s + response 5 s) + pauses ≈ 46 s
end note
Sch -> Lock: acquire "updateRates": lock_until = now + 59 min (database time)
alt lock_until not passed
    Lock --> Sch: skip this run
else lock acquired
    Sch -> S: updateRates()
    S -> DB: active providers by priority, currencies
    loop providers by priority, until valid (every active currency, rate > 0, published within max-age)
        S -> C: fetchRates(provider)
        C -> Ext: GET latest rates (connect 10 s, response 5 s, 3 attempts with backoff)
        Ext --> C: timestamp (publication), rates from USD
    end
    alt no provider gave valid data
        S -> S: log ERROR, metric update failed
        note right: old rates stay valid until rate_end_time
    else this publication already saved (provider_code, rate_begin_time = timestamp)
        S -> S: nothing written, log INFO, metric update succeeded
        note right: a repeated answer does not extend the rates
    else new publication
        S -> DB: active rate_corrections
        S -> S: every pair A→B: base rate of B / base rate of A × coefficient of A→B (1 if none), rounded to 8 digits once
        group one DB transaction, timeout 30 s
            S -> DB: INSERT conversion_rates: begin = publication, end = publication + 3 h, provider_code
            alt DB error or timeout
                S -> DB: ROLLBACK
                S -> S: log ERROR, metric update failed
            else
                S -> DB: COMMIT
                S -> S: log INFO, metric update succeeded + duration
            end
        end
    end
    Sch -> Lock: release: lock_until = locked_at + 59 min (lockAtLeastFor)
end
@enduml
